WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Spill, Pineapple, Host, February

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:03.980
queen

00:01:03.980 --> 00:01:06.450
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.450 --> 00:01:09.060
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:13.060 --> 02:01:37.060
AZALEA

00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:16.530
Come on.

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:19.430
I can't believe that the great Jang Bong Hwan

00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:23.200
This kind of thing is required to maintain life.

00:01:24.870 --> 00:01:27.540
Life is so worthless, isn't it?

00:01:28.840 --> 00:01:31.710
I was really motivated.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:34.920
Can I become a local?
Steve Jobs or Thomas Edison?

00:01:35.750 --> 00:01:37.280
No, I'm taking it low. We need someone great.

00:01:37.280 --> 00:01:40.150
Savior of the human race.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:51.500
In the queen's body sits something

00:01:53.030 --> 00:01:56.300
that shouldn't be there.

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:58.110
Evil spirit.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:03.980
The Queen is possessed by an evil spirit!

00:02:05.280 --> 00:02:07.310
I can't leave you like this.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:09.780
Go away forever.

00:02:16.020 --> 00:02:19.760
Exactly, Carrier! Inventor of air conditioners!

00:02:25.070 --> 00:02:26.270
Your Majesty!

00:02:26.270 --> 00:02:29.370
Come to your senses, Your Majesty! Come on.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.840
Your Majesty!

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.680
Episode 7: Mask

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.580
-Charge 100 joules.
-Move away.

00:02:42.850 --> 00:02:45.150
Administer epinephrine. Charge for 150 joules.

00:02:45.450 --> 00:02:47.650
-Charge 150 joules.
-Move away.

00:02:55.330 --> 00:02:58.000
- Live up.
-I'm coming.

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:02.240
Isn't this the queen's servant?

00:03:02.970 --> 00:03:06.110
And the royal doctor runs after her.

00:03:10.580 --> 00:03:13.510
-What's happened?
-Her Majesty...

00:03:24.860 --> 00:03:27.360
Your Majesty. It's dangerous!

00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:28.800
God.

00:03:32.130 --> 00:03:33.600
Your Majesty.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:37.970
I've been thinking about it, I'm nagging you for your own good...

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.640
Your Majesty.

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.110
Your Majesty!

00:03:44.380 --> 00:03:45.650
What happened here?

00:03:45.650 --> 00:03:48.650
They have already left for the royal physician.

00:03:49.050 --> 00:03:50.450
Your Majesty.

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:53.220
You can't die!

00:03:53.220 --> 00:03:56.190
Don't leave me!

00:03:56.190 --> 00:03:58.760
I won't nag you anymore.

00:03:58.760 --> 00:04:02.330
Come to your senses, Your Majesty.

00:04:03.700 --> 00:04:06.870
Do something!

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:09.570
Your Majesty!

00:04:09.570 --> 00:04:10.570
Hanguk University Hospital, Jang Bong Hwan

00:04:10.570 --> 00:04:12.170
-Charge 100 joules.
-Ready.

00:04:12.170 --> 00:04:13.610
Move away.

00:04:16.440 --> 00:04:18.180
150 joules, done.

00:04:19.950 --> 00:04:22.880
-He's back.
-What is this?

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.620
How bright. What is he doing?

00:04:25.650 --> 00:04:27.850
Pulse is normal. Pressure?

00:04:27.890 --> 00:04:29.320
The pressure is also normal.

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:32.660
Hospital? Am I back?

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:34.560
Returned. The truth is back.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:37.560
Jang Bong Hwan, you were dying.

00:04:37.560 --> 00:04:38.770
I know.

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:41.600
I thought for the rest of my life
I will be locked in a woman's body.

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:43.140
How many days have passed?

00:04:43.140 --> 00:04:45.010
Exactly. How many days did I lie?

00:04:45.010 --> 00:04:46.610
The body is so heavy.

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.140
A week has passed.

00:04:48.140 --> 00:04:50.410
Time passed just like in Joseon.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:51.810
First, help me stand up.

00:04:51.810 --> 00:04:54.250
He was unconscious for a week

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:56.180
now in a vegetative state.

00:04:56.180 --> 00:04:59.190
What does it mean to be in a vegetative state?

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:02.520
Hey Dr. Lee, are you talking about me?

00:05:02.520 --> 00:05:04.630
What a vegetative state, am I normal?

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:05.760
What are you talking about?

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:07.830
-Watch him.
-Yes.

00:05:10.200 --> 00:05:11.430
Where are you going?

00:05:11.430 --> 00:05:13.570
Come back! I'm fine!

00:05:13.570 --> 00:05:15.140
Yes, I'm like a cucumber!

00:05:15.940 --> 00:05:18.540
What? Can't anyone hear me?

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:21.210
I'm here. I'm back.

00:05:21.340 --> 00:05:23.910
Jang Bong Hwan is back!

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:26.650
When will the doctor come?

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:28.320
Queen!

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:30.350
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

00:05:30.750 --> 00:05:33.620
My queen, wake up!

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:36.320
What the hell is going on here?

00:05:36.620 --> 00:05:40.260
She suddenly jumped up

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:43.130
then she turned pale and fell.

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:45.970
How could she fall out of the blue?

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.400
Probably poisoned.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:50.400
She could have been poisoned!

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:51.870
What?

00:05:52.840 --> 00:05:55.710
This can't be true.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.310
We carefully monitor our products

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:59.050
outsiders are not allowed to enter here,

00:05:59.050 --> 00:06:02.380
and the queen didn’t eat anything here.

00:06:02.780 --> 00:06:05.020
Then what was she doing here?

00:06:05.020 --> 00:06:06.750
Did you cook?

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:08.790
Yes.

00:06:09.690 --> 00:06:12.890
She could have gotten poison

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:15.460
tasting the dishes, Your Majesty.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:19.070
There is no way to be sure of this.

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:20.430
Dummies.

00:06:20.430 --> 00:06:22.600
I've always been afraid

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:25.610
that something like this will happen.

00:06:25.740 --> 00:06:29.280
And finally it happened!

00:06:29.380 --> 00:06:32.450
Was she poisoned?

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:35.380
I...

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:37.420
I'll examine her.

00:06:37.420 --> 00:06:38.920
Don't hesitate.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:51.970
Pulse

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:55.100
not like a living one.

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.270
What does it mean?

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.920
Vegetative state.

00:07:12.120 --> 00:07:13.450
Vegetative state?

00:07:13.450 --> 00:07:17.690
Man cannot move and is like a vegetable.

00:07:19.190 --> 00:07:21.730
Her blood and chi energy
gathered in the upper body,

00:07:21.730 --> 00:07:25.370
the spirit has left the body and she hardly breathes.

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:29.140
If the chi energy returns, she will survive. If not -

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:33.210
she will die.

00:07:36.810 --> 00:07:38.380
What does it mean to die?

00:07:39.480 --> 00:07:40.850
What can I do

00:07:40.850 --> 00:07:43.350
what to do to save her?

00:07:43.950 --> 00:07:48.090
You need to pour hibiscus decoction and calamus juice into her mouth.

00:07:48.090 --> 00:07:49.460
Chief Eunuch.

00:07:49.460 --> 00:07:51.090
Bring everything immediately!

00:07:51.090 --> 00:07:52.490
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:07:52.490 --> 00:07:54.860
Will the Queen last until then?

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.730
This is the problem.

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:00.830
Don't just stand there, do something!

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.440
Save our queen.

00:08:03.440 --> 00:08:07.270
To do anything, you need to move it.

00:08:11.450 --> 00:08:13.080
Let's go to the Daejojeon Hall.

00:08:14.410 --> 00:08:15.920
Your Majesty.

00:08:16.480 --> 00:08:18.080
Queen Mother.

00:08:18.450 --> 00:08:22.020
It is necessary to expel the evil spirit from the queen's body.

00:08:22.320 --> 00:08:24.160
You can't hesitate.

00:08:24.620 --> 00:08:27.230
And how to do this?

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:29.900
We will place it around the Daejojeon Hall
frightening objects

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:31.900
and block the energy.

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:34.840
And then we will perform the ritual of expelling the spirit.

00:08:35.440 --> 00:08:38.540
It's dangerous. Cannot be carried out
such a ritual in the palace.

00:08:38.840 --> 00:08:40.010
If we get caught...

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:43.010
There is no point in holding the ceremony outside the palace.

00:08:43.340 --> 00:08:47.410
In order for the ritual to be successful, perform it

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:49.380
necessary near the queen.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.900
Live up.

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:04.400
Yes.

00:09:04.400 --> 00:09:07.130
-Did you finish?
-Yes, everything is ready.

00:09:20.180 --> 00:09:22.420
What's happened?

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:25.120
The patient had cardiac arrest.

00:09:25.120 --> 00:09:27.450
Listen. Here. Look here.

00:09:27.450 --> 00:09:29.020
Can you hear me?

00:09:32.160 --> 00:09:33.460
Did he say something?

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:36.230
Yes. Can you hear? I knew it.

00:09:36.230 --> 00:09:39.370
I hear and see everything, I am not a vegetable.

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:42.100
Is it true?

00:09:42.100 --> 00:09:43.400
Is he really talking?

00:09:43.400 --> 00:09:44.600
He is falsely accused.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:46.810
Hey dumbass, you idiot.

00:09:46.810 --> 00:09:49.840
-I hear you, moron.
-I'm sure he feels that way.

00:09:49.980 --> 00:09:52.310
He's in the middle of the Khan scandal
and the Prime Minister

00:09:52.310 --> 00:09:53.750
and is going to take all the blame on himself.

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.220
What is this?

00:09:55.220 --> 00:09:57.920
Director Han's tricks?

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.700
Start treatment.

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:14.470
He seems crazy

00:10:14.470 --> 00:10:16.740
but it’s unlikely that you’ll be able to pin everything on him.

00:10:16.740 --> 00:10:20.370
What can he do? He's a loser anyway.

00:10:20.370 --> 00:10:22.740
The best way for him is to lie here.

00:10:22.740 --> 00:10:24.410
Are you serious now?

00:10:24.410 --> 00:10:27.550
If they were in my place, would they lie and suffer?

00:10:27.550 --> 00:10:30.080
Can detectives say that?

00:10:32.550 --> 00:10:34.020
Now

00:10:34.150 --> 00:10:37.790
I'll put my life on the line and get acupuncture.

00:10:53.340 --> 00:10:54.940
I won't let him get away with this.

00:10:55.010 --> 00:10:58.780
To the villain Director Khan.

00:11:03.050 --> 00:11:04.150
Holy spirits!

00:11:04.150 --> 00:11:07.120
I'll bite his back!

00:11:11.260 --> 00:11:13.730
What have you forgotten here?

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:18.930
Queen!

00:11:18.930 --> 00:11:20.500
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:21.900
Your Majesty!

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:25.470
You've already eaten so much
forgetting about caution!

00:11:25.470 --> 00:11:28.070
What are you going to snack on there?

00:11:36.980 --> 00:11:39.750
The worst is over.

00:11:40.990 --> 00:11:43.460
But why didn't she wake up?

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:45.490
The queen breathes again

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:48.900
but she had not yet fully come to her senses.

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:51.700
We have to keep an eye on her

00:11:51.800 --> 00:11:54.130
the queen may get worse.

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:57.400
In other words, it's not over yet?

00:11:57.400 --> 00:11:58.940
Tonight

00:11:59.310 --> 00:12:00.970
everything will be decided.

00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:14.490
The king went to Daejojong Hall.

00:12:16.220 --> 00:12:17.420
For what?

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.790
The Queen fainted

00:12:20.060 --> 00:12:22.900
he wants to stay by her bedside and look after her.

00:12:27.000 --> 00:12:28.500
Fine.

00:12:28.670 --> 00:12:30.600
It's worth changing...

00:12:30.600 --> 00:12:32.510
I said everything is fine.

00:13:05.310 --> 00:13:06.870
Keep your mouth shut.

00:13:07.370 --> 00:13:10.240
Find out who, your life will be in danger.

00:13:10.240 --> 00:13:13.110
Of course, I understand everything.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:23.020
I can't believe that this girl
subordinate to the court lady Choi.

00:13:23.160 --> 00:13:26.890
Everything is going just right.

00:13:27.630 --> 00:13:31.430
I knew it, the spirits were on our side.

00:13:31.430 --> 00:13:33.400
Queen Mother, are you here?

00:13:45.510 --> 00:13:47.750
I want to perform a ritual

00:13:47.750 --> 00:13:49.920
Here, I’m preparing for it.

00:13:49.920 --> 00:13:52.750
It's nothing serious, so have a seat.

00:13:53.690 --> 00:13:55.590
I want to talk to you.

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.530
I know about everything.

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.960
You asked your father to spare the queen.

00:14:04.160 --> 00:14:06.300
That time you said

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:10.070
that I don't have to act alone.

00:14:10.070 --> 00:14:12.510
-Right.
-But what

00:14:13.540 --> 00:14:15.640
if I want to do anything?

00:14:17.380 --> 00:14:18.810
Then

00:14:19.950 --> 00:14:22.920
Can I surpass the queen?

00:14:46.910 --> 00:14:50.780
I'll stay all night, you can go.

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:54.710
It's late, I'm afraid how you

00:14:54.710 --> 00:14:56.550
didn't get sick either.

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:58.250
Everything will be fine.

00:14:58.690 --> 00:15:01.050
You can go.

00:15:01.390 --> 00:15:02.820
Yes.

00:15:15.270 --> 00:15:18.740
I haven't had a single quiet day here.

00:15:19.010 --> 00:15:22.240
The husband with whom I share the same blanket is trying to kill me.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:25.450
You'll feel numb

00:15:25.450 --> 00:15:26.980
don't hesitate and strike.

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.480
Leave?

00:15:28.580 --> 00:15:30.520
I mustered up the courage to apologize

00:15:30.520 --> 00:15:32.850
and this is what I get in response?

00:15:33.020 --> 00:15:35.620
Listen, if the only person who needs an apology is

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:37.290
who apologizes, and not to the one who receives them,

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:38.760
Is this an apology?

00:15:39.490 --> 00:15:42.700
The moment has passed. There's no point in saying anything.

00:15:45.530 --> 00:15:47.900
I was hoping

00:15:48.270 --> 00:15:50.800
that I will have a chance to understand you.

00:15:57.410 --> 00:16:01.580
This is a very expensive fabric.

00:16:01.880 --> 00:16:04.250
If I used it

00:16:04.480 --> 00:16:06.890
I would remember it for the rest of my life.

00:16:06.890 --> 00:16:08.390
Are you sure?

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:12.630
Silk was brought to you to make

00:16:12.630 --> 00:16:14.690
silk flowers for a banquet.

00:16:14.690 --> 00:16:15.930
Right.

00:16:15.930 --> 00:16:19.400
And do you have any excess fabric left?

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:23.000
The point is

00:16:24.200 --> 00:16:25.610
head of the kitchen

00:16:25.610 --> 00:16:28.440
Mr. Kim Mungeun took the fabric.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:37.880
Was there a similar one among that fabric?

00:16:38.480 --> 00:16:40.650
This is...

00:17:00.340 --> 00:17:02.180
I saw him burn something valuable

00:17:02.180 --> 00:17:05.350
found it suspicious and took it out of the fire.

00:17:05.380 --> 00:17:06.950
I'm sure it's her.

00:17:08.780 --> 00:17:10.520
Prince Yeonpyeong?

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:20.690
Did the king have something to do with this?

00:17:21.130 --> 00:17:22.660
What did you say?

00:17:22.660 --> 00:17:24.060
Queen Mother and Concubine Cho

00:17:24.060 --> 00:17:26.900
performing a ritual together within the walls of the palace?

00:17:26.970 --> 00:17:28.370
Right.

00:17:29.270 --> 00:17:31.840
I thought the royal concubine
have enough brains not to get involved in this,

00:17:31.840 --> 00:17:34.670
but she seems to be just like the Queen Mother.

00:17:35.880 --> 00:17:37.280
That's even better.

00:17:37.280 --> 00:17:40.410
I can teach you a good lesson
these abnormal ones.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.120
If you reprimand them for the ritual

00:17:42.120 --> 00:17:44.620
and talismans, rumors will spread.

00:17:45.280 --> 00:17:47.490
But they won't stop.

00:17:48.120 --> 00:17:49.820
You're right.

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:53.530
I wish I could do
something more substantial.

00:17:55.930 --> 00:17:58.930
This is the chief eunuch! I have urgent news!

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:00.330
Come in.

00:18:06.010 --> 00:18:07.570
What's happened?

00:18:07.770 --> 00:18:12.180
The queen lost her breath and was unconscious.

00:18:13.350 --> 00:18:15.010
Lost breath?

00:18:15.010 --> 00:18:18.320
The doctor gave her back her breath,

00:18:18.320 --> 00:18:20.720
but she needs to be watched all night.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:23.020
What happened?

00:18:23.020 --> 00:18:28.900
It is suspected that the queen was poisoned while cooking in the kitchen.

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:38.870
Kim Soyeon

00:19:14.570 --> 00:19:16.940
If you want to fight with all your heart,

00:19:19.610 --> 00:19:22.080
if you want to overcome her with all your heart,

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:27.220
then from now on
You shouldn't have secrets from me.

00:19:30.790 --> 00:19:32.630
Do you agree?

00:19:34.360 --> 00:19:37.700
Yes, I agree.

00:19:40.700 --> 00:19:43.140
Then tell me if it's worth it

00:19:43.140 --> 00:19:45.970
should the king know what's going on here?

00:19:55.820 --> 00:19:57.920
The king wishes

00:19:58.890 --> 00:20:01.050
the same as us.

00:20:15.700 --> 00:20:18.040
Is she breathing?

00:20:24.080 --> 00:20:25.710
Breathing.

00:20:26.280 --> 00:20:27.610
But if she's sleeping,

00:20:27.610 --> 00:20:30.520
why is she so quiet?

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:36.260
What's happened? Are you hurt?

00:20:36.320 --> 00:20:38.160
Why?

00:20:39.290 --> 00:20:42.230
You always wanted a daughter

00:20:42.830 --> 00:20:45.500
are you happy now?

00:20:47.670 --> 00:20:50.140
You are in pain, you are suffering.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.440
It must be even stronger now
you miss your mother.

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:17.260
You can handle everything.

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:21.270
Get well soon
to be full of strength and energy again.

00:21:21.500 --> 00:21:25.910
You promised me to live
following the social distancing rule.

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:30.580
I will forgive you and your strange speech,

00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:33.050
and cocky behavior.

00:21:37.420 --> 00:21:39.590
Just wake up.

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:01.170
I'm so glad you haven't left yet.

00:22:01.170 --> 00:22:02.980
What's happened?

00:22:02.980 --> 00:22:05.750
The queen is in a vegetative state.

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:08.580
Has she stopped breathing?

00:22:08.580 --> 00:22:11.420
Fortunately, the doctor returned it to her.

00:22:12.290 --> 00:22:15.790
I want you to go to Seongwonjong Hall.

00:22:16.890 --> 00:22:19.160
Someone wants to harm the queen?

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:23.430
We'll strike
by Queen Mother and Concubine Cho.

00:22:30.340 --> 00:22:34.010
Go away, evil spirit!

00:22:34.010 --> 00:22:37.680
Gods, listen to my prayers!

00:22:37.680 --> 00:22:42.780
Cast out the evil spirit!

00:22:50.520 --> 00:22:52.560
What are you doing?

00:22:53.460 --> 00:22:56.730
How dare you break in here?
Don't know what this place is?

00:22:56.730 --> 00:22:59.100
Do you think you can get away with this?

00:23:06.570 --> 00:23:09.410
I'll ask you the same thing.
Do you think it's a threat to life?

00:23:09.410 --> 00:23:11.610
Queens can you get away with it?

00:23:13.880 --> 00:23:15.450
-What's happened?
-Out of the way!

00:23:15.450 --> 00:23:18.150
-What are you doing?
-Search everything!

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:21.490
What a horror! What are you doing?

00:23:21.490 --> 00:23:23.860
-Oh no!
-What horror!

00:23:25.090 --> 00:23:29.730
I prayed for a peaceful life in the palace!

00:23:36.540 --> 00:23:39.970
This rat was found near the Daejojeon Hall.

00:23:40.110 --> 00:23:43.110
I have nothing to do with it.

00:23:43.980 --> 00:23:46.850
Do you want to say that the shaman acted alone?

00:23:47.980 --> 00:23:52.890
It seems your gods haven't told you when you'll die.

00:23:55.390 --> 00:23:57.520
It will happen today.

00:24:00.690 --> 00:24:03.630
Please, have mercy on me.

00:24:03.830 --> 00:24:08.000
I was only following the Queen Mother's orders.

00:24:08.030 --> 00:24:09.570
Shut your mouth!

00:24:11.070 --> 00:24:15.570
I will perform a ritual that will break the curse.

00:24:16.210 --> 00:24:18.680
A ritual that will break the curse?

00:24:20.950 --> 00:24:23.080
You serve God, not your king!

00:24:23.080 --> 00:24:25.350
Apparently you decided that the palace is a circus!

00:24:25.350 --> 00:24:26.890
Everything is wrong!

00:24:27.090 --> 00:24:28.250
Late.

00:24:28.250 --> 00:24:30.760
The queen's life is in danger.

00:24:32.560 --> 00:24:33.860
This cannot be true.

00:24:33.860 --> 00:24:35.730
You performed the ritual.

00:24:35.730 --> 00:24:38.560
And now you don’t believe in its consequences?

00:24:39.700 --> 00:24:41.230
You have been deceived by a scammer!

00:24:41.230 --> 00:24:43.170
Look what this has led to!

00:24:43.770 --> 00:24:46.470
Because of you, the reputation of the entire dynasty has come to an end,

00:24:46.470 --> 00:24:48.340
you tried to kill the queen,

00:24:48.340 --> 00:24:49.610
and also committed a serious crime,

00:24:49.610 --> 00:24:51.040
leaving us all confused!

00:24:51.040 --> 00:24:54.780
How are you going to pay for your sins?

00:24:56.020 --> 00:25:00.190
May I know the queen's condition?

00:25:02.120 --> 00:25:04.920
Pretending like you don't know the answer?

00:25:04.920 --> 00:25:07.430
Well, I'll tell you what happened to the queen.

00:25:07.860 --> 00:25:09.400
She was poisoned.

00:25:10.000 --> 00:25:13.900
Arsenic was found among the food in the kitchen.

00:25:16.340 --> 00:25:17.800
Arsenic.

00:25:18.540 --> 00:25:22.040
I'm sure you know what kind of poison this is.

00:25:31.780 --> 00:25:33.390
I'm sure

00:25:34.190 --> 00:25:37.990
you know more about her than I do.

00:25:40.030 --> 00:25:42.190
And again you are back to your old ways.

00:25:42.600 --> 00:25:46.700
Again you accuse me of killing the king.

00:25:49.740 --> 00:25:53.910
People are fools who quickly forget the past.

00:25:54.610 --> 00:25:58.680
Not knowing how valuable a life saved at the cost of the life of one’s own child is.

00:26:03.780 --> 00:26:05.750
That time it was you

00:26:05.750 --> 00:26:08.120
begged me.

00:26:08.490 --> 00:26:10.920
Instead of investigating the king's death,

00:26:10.920 --> 00:26:12.390
poisoned with arsenic,

00:26:12.390 --> 00:26:15.260
you asked me for your life.

00:26:17.660 --> 00:26:19.400
And what do I see?

00:26:19.400 --> 00:26:23.270
You lured the innocent concubine Cho into your dirty rituals and tried to poison the queen!

00:26:23.370 --> 00:26:26.770
Aren't you ashamed of the deceased king?

00:26:27.740 --> 00:26:29.840
Although why be surprised, if you have a conscience,

00:26:29.840 --> 00:26:32.480
you would die after him.

00:26:33.710 --> 00:26:37.020
There is no use in apologizing.

00:26:38.780 --> 00:26:41.320
You know more than anyone else

00:26:41.390 --> 00:26:43.920
how much I have done wrong.

00:26:43.920 --> 00:26:46.560
Since you think so, I have no choice.

00:26:46.560 --> 00:26:47.960
I order

00:26:48.190 --> 00:26:51.960
quarter the shaman and the court lady Khan!

00:26:51.960 --> 00:26:53.370
-Yes!
-Yes!

00:26:55.100 --> 00:27:00.570
Please, have mercy on me!

00:27:00.570 --> 00:27:03.610
Let me in!

00:27:04.710 --> 00:27:06.650
As for the Queen Mother...

00:27:08.210 --> 00:27:09.650
Please!

00:27:11.720 --> 00:27:13.320
Have mercy!

00:27:15.050 --> 00:27:17.760
Please have mercy on me!

00:27:17.760 --> 00:27:20.360
Praying won't help you this time!

00:27:20.360 --> 00:27:24.300
How long should I turn a blind eye to your misdeeds?

00:27:24.300 --> 00:27:27.230
This time you won't get off that easy!

00:27:27.530 --> 00:27:29.070
I was wrong!

00:27:29.230 --> 00:27:32.470
Please give me a chance

00:27:32.470 --> 00:27:34.340
atone for guilt!

00:27:34.340 --> 00:27:38.280
How are you going to atone for such a grave sin?

00:27:41.810 --> 00:27:44.450
You must be sure

00:27:45.720 --> 00:27:47.190
that the king

00:27:47.620 --> 00:27:51.520
submits to you with all his soul.

00:27:52.060 --> 00:27:54.960
You were sure that the deceased king was in your power,

00:27:54.960 --> 00:27:58.460
therefore they resigned as regent.

00:27:58.560 --> 00:28:00.530
Or have you forgotten?

00:28:10.380 --> 00:28:12.980
Are the Queen Mother's words troubling you?

00:28:18.950 --> 00:28:21.150
For your peace of mind, I will check

00:28:22.090 --> 00:28:24.320
What kind of a man is His Majesty.

00:28:33.630 --> 00:28:35.770
What are you doing here?

00:28:38.340 --> 00:28:39.810
Your Majesty!

00:28:47.910 --> 00:28:49.280
What's all the commotion?

00:28:49.280 --> 00:28:51.450
I'm transferring the queen.

00:28:52.920 --> 00:28:54.420
Are you transporting?

00:28:55.220 --> 00:28:56.590
Where?

00:28:57.120 --> 00:28:59.020
I can't tell you.

00:29:11.200 --> 00:29:14.510
Can you tell me where you are taking the queen?

00:29:18.310 --> 00:29:20.310
Did something happen?

00:29:20.810 --> 00:29:22.410
A mask of lies.

00:29:22.410 --> 00:29:26.620
The queen was cursed in Seongwonjong.

00:29:26.990 --> 00:29:28.450
It was the Queen Mother

00:29:28.990 --> 00:29:31.090
and Royal Concubine Cho.

00:29:33.060 --> 00:29:36.130
Concubine Cho would never do such a thing.

00:29:36.700 --> 00:29:40.100
Are you saying the queen's illness is due to a curse?

00:29:40.970 --> 00:29:43.770
Arsenic was found in the royal kitchen.

00:29:48.640 --> 00:29:51.840
Now the investigation will be conducted by the Detective Department.

00:29:52.080 --> 00:29:54.910
In this regard, I have questions for you.

00:29:56.180 --> 00:29:58.480
What and where did you do with Prince Yeonpyeong

00:29:58.980 --> 00:30:02.520
the night after the royal wedding?

00:30:04.420 --> 00:30:07.090
What do you allow yourself?

00:30:07.230 --> 00:30:09.730
Show your real face.

00:30:09.730 --> 00:30:12.160
Apparently your memory is failing you.

00:30:12.970 --> 00:30:16.470
If this is the case, I will have to formally interrogate the prince.

00:30:21.110 --> 00:30:23.010
Not a step further!

00:30:26.880 --> 00:30:28.310
Your Majesty.

00:30:39.220 --> 00:30:41.660
Please don't move.

00:30:42.130 --> 00:30:46.330
Otherwise your guards will have to
disrespect and harm you.

00:31:03.680 --> 00:31:05.250
Stop.

00:31:06.350 --> 00:31:07.920
This is the king's order.

00:31:12.520 --> 00:31:14.230
This is my woman.

00:31:16.400 --> 00:31:19.600
Just touch her with your finger,

00:31:20.100 --> 00:31:22.770
and this sword will cut your throat.

00:31:30.210 --> 00:31:34.110
I didn't know the queen was so dear to you.

00:31:34.450 --> 00:31:36.850
There's a lot you don't know.

00:31:38.020 --> 00:31:40.290
Let me teach you a lesson.

00:31:54.930 --> 00:31:56.670
Do you see me?

00:32:01.370 --> 00:32:04.510
I am the king of this country!

00:32:07.310 --> 00:32:09.850
Whose warriors are you?

00:32:11.420 --> 00:32:13.220
My guard.

00:32:14.450 --> 00:32:16.690
Move away.

00:32:29.640 --> 00:32:31.140
Your Majesty.

00:32:35.140 --> 00:32:37.240
Isn't this treason?

00:32:38.080 --> 00:32:39.980
Get your people out

00:32:40.210 --> 00:32:43.420
if you don't want to
for blood to be shed in Daejojon.

00:32:43.480 --> 00:32:46.620
If you command, Prince Yeonpyeong

00:32:46.620 --> 00:32:49.990
happy to get his hands dirty.

00:32:51.090 --> 00:32:53.560
I just have questions for you.

00:32:53.760 --> 00:32:55.930
You came on time.

00:32:59.030 --> 00:33:01.930
I did not order the investigation to begin.

00:33:03.840 --> 00:33:08.170
Who does the Detective Department report to now?

00:33:13.510 --> 00:33:16.210
I'll look into the matter myself first.

00:33:18.050 --> 00:33:21.050
And you can't blame the innocent again.

00:33:21.050 --> 00:33:24.320
Only the queen is innocent here!

00:33:25.190 --> 00:33:27.130
I already told you.

00:33:27.130 --> 00:33:31.000
Make her suffer
and your life will also become torture.

00:33:32.530 --> 00:33:37.100
I said it was not a threat.
But I have to take my words back.

00:33:37.100 --> 00:33:38.740
How dare you!

00:33:49.280 --> 00:33:53.020
This woman is no longer your cousin.

00:33:54.190 --> 00:33:56.220
Her happiness

00:33:56.590 --> 00:33:59.860
sorrows and safety are now a concern

00:34:00.330 --> 00:34:03.030
not the head of the Detective Department - you,

00:34:03.560 --> 00:34:05.230
and mine.

00:34:10.270 --> 00:34:12.670
The Queen will be taken to her family's home.

00:34:15.870 --> 00:34:17.940
Prepare the palanquin.

00:34:18.440 --> 00:34:19.850
-Yes.
-Yes.

00:34:31.390 --> 00:34:32.860
Let's leave.

00:34:43.770 --> 00:34:45.300
I'm late.

00:34:45.300 --> 00:34:46.740
You are so

00:34:47.740 --> 00:34:49.840
tried to hide this side of themselves.

00:35:12.030 --> 00:35:13.800
Watch her carefully.

00:35:14.030 --> 00:35:15.430
Yes.

00:35:15.600 --> 00:35:17.770
I'm sorry for leaving you alone.

00:35:31.280 --> 00:35:34.120
Stay alert until you arrive.

00:35:34.250 --> 00:35:36.790
And stand guard all night upon arrival.

00:35:36.790 --> 00:35:38.290
Yes!

00:35:53.610 --> 00:35:57.780
I bet everyone but me
will be able to breathe out in the palace.

00:35:58.180 --> 00:36:01.550
And why does this make you feel better?

00:36:04.220 --> 00:36:07.850
Wait, Kim Hwan should have been here by now.

00:36:10.060 --> 00:36:11.690
And here is the devil himself.

00:36:15.130 --> 00:36:16.630
I was already worried that we wouldn't meet

00:36:16.630 --> 00:36:18.500
before I leave...

00:36:20.000 --> 00:36:21.500
Who is this?

00:36:22.730 --> 00:36:25.940
Today I found a good friend.

00:36:25.940 --> 00:36:29.310
This is Lee Senban.

00:36:29.310 --> 00:36:32.480
We met when I was looking for my friend Lee Senman.

00:36:33.110 --> 00:36:37.050
We are destined to be friends.

00:36:37.620 --> 00:36:39.750
I wanted to have a drink with you

00:36:40.020 --> 00:36:42.050
and play cards.

00:36:42.590 --> 00:36:44.990
Do you want a tavern here or what?

00:36:45.220 --> 00:36:48.460
Drink and play cards? What kind of person are you?

00:36:48.460 --> 00:36:51.500
And what? That's what we do here.

00:36:51.500 --> 00:36:53.830
Only you can do this.

00:36:53.830 --> 00:36:56.570
Only for you, Kim Hwan.

00:36:57.970 --> 00:37:00.510
-Only for you.
-What?

00:37:01.110 --> 00:37:04.280
I didn't know it was so easy to get interested in you.

00:37:04.410 --> 00:37:07.750
Is it that easy for you to make friends?
Do you have more of them than you could possibly wish for?

00:37:07.750 --> 00:37:10.250
Apparently I was one of your friends for the evening,

00:37:10.250 --> 00:37:13.490
one of your many friends.

00:37:46.350 --> 00:37:49.590
Well, did you send your friend Lee Sengbang home?

00:37:49.590 --> 00:37:51.320
You are called to the palace.

00:37:52.190 --> 00:37:53.630
What?

00:37:59.300 --> 00:38:01.330
Why is no one here today?

00:38:01.930 --> 00:38:06.610
Everyone went to see
for something interesting without me?

00:38:09.170 --> 00:38:12.140
Feeling like everyone has abandoned me.

00:38:22.120 --> 00:38:24.520
Lee Senman, you're alive!

00:38:24.520 --> 00:38:26.860
Finally met!

00:38:31.300 --> 00:38:34.930
I made a mistake, I confused you with a friend.

00:38:35.470 --> 00:38:36.970
I'm sorry.

00:38:39.900 --> 00:38:42.170
I'm not your friend.

00:38:42.540 --> 00:38:45.210
But I have something interesting.

00:38:53.250 --> 00:38:56.890
What are these things? They look strange.

00:38:56.890 --> 00:38:58.420
This...

00:39:01.560 --> 00:39:03.160
The curfew has not yet been lifted.

00:39:03.160 --> 00:39:05.860
-Why are you on the street?
- Hide it.

00:39:08.000 --> 00:39:09.500
You...

00:39:10.340 --> 00:39:13.640
Was one spanking not enough?

00:39:13.640 --> 00:39:15.710
Are you selling books with obscenities again?

00:39:15.710 --> 00:39:17.110
Obscenity?

00:39:19.580 --> 00:39:22.910
It was he who wanted to sell them to me.

00:39:23.650 --> 00:39:25.280
You are accused of violating morality.

00:39:25.280 --> 00:39:26.850
Take them away.

00:39:26.850 --> 00:39:28.150
Yes.

00:39:28.150 --> 00:39:30.920
-Wait, I...
-Let me go.

00:39:30.920 --> 00:39:32.660
-Wait.
-Wait.

00:39:32.660 --> 00:39:34.530
-You can be more gentle.
-Here is Herod.

00:39:34.530 --> 00:39:36.530
You can be gentler, but I'm scared.

00:39:36.530 --> 00:39:40.100
He asked specifically about the night after the wedding.

00:39:40.400 --> 00:39:42.670
So the queen told him everything.

00:39:42.670 --> 00:39:46.000
It seemed strange to me that she was silent for so long.

00:39:46.000 --> 00:39:48.640
If he knew that I tried to kill her,

00:39:48.910 --> 00:39:51.040
The matter would not have ended with just one interrogation.

00:39:51.180 --> 00:39:54.650
On the day of his appointment, he read out the saying:

00:39:54.650 --> 00:39:56.950
"Having saved the empire from discord,

00:39:57.120 --> 00:39:59.280
power strikes fear into the king."

00:39:59.280 --> 00:40:00.820
Self-confident turkey.

00:40:00.820 --> 00:40:03.420
He threatened to take away your throne.

00:40:03.420 --> 00:40:07.160
If he's willing to go that far,
you should have bitten your tongue.

00:40:07.160 --> 00:40:08.660
And then

00:40:08.660 --> 00:40:10.930
he would continue to put pressure on His Majesty.

00:40:11.130 --> 00:40:13.400
His Majesty would have revealed himself anyway.

00:40:13.400 --> 00:40:14.970
Smart guy.

00:40:15.900 --> 00:40:18.400
He must have found something.

00:40:18.600 --> 00:40:21.210
I'll find out how much he knows.

00:40:21.970 --> 00:40:26.180
For now we can only hope
that the queen will wake up.

00:40:26.410 --> 00:40:30.010
This is the most important thing for everyone.

00:40:30.010 --> 00:40:31.350
What about training?

00:40:31.350 --> 00:40:33.320
Kim Byungin is hunting our heads.

00:40:33.320 --> 00:40:35.890
We need to put in even more effort.

00:40:35.920 --> 00:40:38.920
There is very little time left.

00:40:39.920 --> 00:40:41.360
God.

00:40:41.590 --> 00:40:43.430
Raise the lantern.

00:40:53.810 --> 00:40:55.710
How far is Her Majesty?

00:40:55.770 --> 00:40:56.810
She's on her way here.

00:40:56.810 --> 00:40:59.310
Are you sure she's not on the verge of death?

00:40:59.880 --> 00:41:01.680
Yes, fortunately, everything worked out.

00:41:01.680 --> 00:41:03.180
God.

00:41:03.750 --> 00:41:05.720
How could this happen?

00:41:06.150 --> 00:41:08.990
Poisoned? How could she be poisoned?

00:41:09.120 --> 00:41:12.920
I have already called the best doctors in Joseon.

00:41:13.590 --> 00:41:15.060
God.

00:41:15.390 --> 00:41:18.200
Be that as it may,
you need to remain calm.

00:41:19.760 --> 00:41:23.400
You need to calm down and think rationally.

00:41:24.670 --> 00:41:26.070
What is it?

00:41:26.540 --> 00:41:28.710
God.

00:41:29.370 --> 00:41:32.880
God.

00:41:33.280 --> 00:41:35.050
How cruel.

00:41:35.080 --> 00:41:37.120
The Queen Mother's husband was poisoned.

00:41:37.120 --> 00:41:38.880
How can you blame her?

00:41:38.880 --> 00:41:40.220
The situation is difficult

00:41:40.220 --> 00:41:43.560
Hwajin, stay away from the Queen Mother.

00:41:43.690 --> 00:41:45.460
This happened on the day of my visit.

00:41:45.460 --> 00:41:47.330
I gave them an opportunity.

00:41:47.330 --> 00:41:49.130
Don't beat yourself up over this.

00:41:49.330 --> 00:41:51.560
They would have made their move anyway.

00:41:52.100 --> 00:41:53.530
But

00:41:54.370 --> 00:41:57.500
why did you move the queen back to her father's house?

00:41:57.500 --> 00:41:59.840
She must have been lonely in the palace.

00:41:59.870 --> 00:42:02.240
In her dream she called her mother.

00:42:03.340 --> 00:42:06.780
But Her Majesty dreamed about it.

00:42:07.710 --> 00:42:09.110
About what?

00:42:09.310 --> 00:42:11.120
Is something wrong?

00:42:13.550 --> 00:42:16.720
-No.
-Don't worry.

00:42:16.750 --> 00:42:19.990
I will send my brother as soon as everything is decided.

00:42:26.160 --> 00:42:27.600
Your Majesty.

00:42:34.840 --> 00:42:36.310
I beg you.

00:42:36.540 --> 00:42:38.910
Will you go against the will of the king?

00:42:44.780 --> 00:42:46.480
Please don't get hurt.

00:42:48.890 --> 00:42:50.290
Fine.

00:43:05.440 --> 00:43:07.340
Now that you're here

00:43:08.240 --> 00:43:10.810
It's like we've gone back in time.

00:43:13.280 --> 00:43:14.710
Benin.

00:43:18.550 --> 00:43:22.150
You're the only one looking for me when I run away.

00:43:22.650 --> 00:43:24.890
I won't let you lose yourself.

00:43:26.960 --> 00:43:28.990
And I will never forget.

00:43:32.660 --> 00:43:34.900
If only I could go back to that day.

00:43:41.240 --> 00:43:43.070
This is my woman.

00:43:49.180 --> 00:43:51.450
You were supposed to be mine.

00:43:54.050 --> 00:43:56.320
And I am yours.

00:44:44.340 --> 00:44:46.170
Do you even know who I am?

00:44:46.170 --> 00:44:49.440
The same Kim Hwan who is about to become an official

00:44:49.610 --> 00:44:50.880
Detective department.

00:44:50.880 --> 00:44:52.710
It wasn't enough what he did,

00:44:52.710 --> 00:44:54.250
decided to bargain with your future appointment?

00:44:54.250 --> 00:44:55.310
Bargain?

00:44:55.310 --> 00:44:57.420
I am a righteous man.

00:44:58.280 --> 00:45:00.790
Is it really by face and talents?

00:45:00.790 --> 00:45:04.090
can't you see that I'm Sungkyunkwan's student?

00:45:04.120 --> 00:45:07.490
I will not tolerate injustice...

00:45:07.490 --> 00:45:09.060
Quiet here.

00:45:09.690 --> 00:45:11.500
Look what a talkative guy you got.

00:45:11.500 --> 00:45:14.430
How dare you? If you let me go immediately,

00:45:14.430 --> 00:45:17.040
I'll give you five nyans in silver.

00:45:17.100 --> 00:45:18.570
Or can you

00:45:20.910 --> 00:45:22.570
give them to me?

00:45:23.910 --> 00:45:27.150
In return, we will teach you an invaluable lesson.

00:45:36.190 --> 00:45:38.190
As soon as you hear what I say,

00:45:40.830 --> 00:45:44.000
you will no longer be who you were.

00:45:45.560 --> 00:45:48.970
You will become truly mature.

00:46:04.350 --> 00:46:07.890
-Are you going to the palace?
-Yes. Have you just returned home?

00:46:07.920 --> 00:46:10.190
Heard what happened
between you and the king yesterday.

00:46:10.190 --> 00:46:12.520
Yes, I understand.

00:46:12.520 --> 00:46:14.690
Even if he doesn't look great,

00:46:14.690 --> 00:46:18.030
If you put so much pressure on him, he will become one.

00:46:18.030 --> 00:46:20.360
Why did he act without my order?

00:46:20.360 --> 00:46:21.800
This is because...

00:46:22.400 --> 00:46:24.070
His eyes.

00:46:24.370 --> 00:46:28.140
He has the eyes of a man
hiding his aspirations.

00:46:31.210 --> 00:46:34.780
I didn't want the Queen Dowager to worry,

00:46:35.150 --> 00:46:37.010
So he acted rashly.

00:46:38.720 --> 00:46:40.380
Be careful.

00:46:41.990 --> 00:46:43.390
Father.

00:46:45.960 --> 00:46:50.030
Did you find out how the queen is doing?

00:46:50.630 --> 00:46:53.060
I heard the crisis is over.

00:46:53.060 --> 00:46:55.870
She hasn't come to her senses yet.

00:46:56.070 --> 00:46:58.900
But he'll get better soon.

00:47:00.340 --> 00:47:02.140
Anything else you want to say?

00:47:02.370 --> 00:47:04.640
I heard the dowager queen

00:47:04.640 --> 00:47:06.340
mentioned the deposition of the queen.

00:47:06.340 --> 00:47:08.610
She said this in a fit of anger.

00:47:08.610 --> 00:47:10.180
She doesn't really want this.

00:47:10.180 --> 00:47:12.480
You have nothing to worry about.

00:47:13.050 --> 00:47:16.890
I know very well how much you care for the queen.

00:47:16.890 --> 00:47:18.520
Maybe not as much as you

00:47:18.520 --> 00:47:21.930
but I take good care of her too, so don't worry.

00:47:22.930 --> 00:47:24.330
Yes.

00:47:24.600 --> 00:47:26.230
See you at the palace.

00:47:46.220 --> 00:47:50.090
The queen's father sent gifts again.

00:47:50.890 --> 00:47:53.220
How is the queen?

00:47:53.660 --> 00:47:55.490
The crisis is over

00:47:55.490 --> 00:47:58.230
but she needs rest for now,
so she returned home.

00:47:58.230 --> 00:48:00.600
She is constantly sick.

00:48:00.900 --> 00:48:02.970
She never recovered from that incident.

00:48:02.970 --> 00:48:04.670
What should I call it?

00:48:04.970 --> 00:48:06.900
It's like she's broken.

00:48:07.210 --> 00:48:09.810
I'm trying to let her get stronger

00:48:09.810 --> 00:48:13.510
but suddenly she becomes a vegetable.
She's too weak.

00:48:13.850 --> 00:48:16.780
What if Concubine Cho gives birth to a prince first?

00:48:16.780 --> 00:48:18.820
Then the Queen Mother will rebel again.

00:48:18.820 --> 00:48:20.450
Don't worry.

00:48:20.450 --> 00:48:23.220
I have prepared a backup plan.

00:48:23.450 --> 00:48:24.720
Backup plan?

00:48:24.720 --> 00:48:27.360
I made sure that the other two
who we considered for the role of queen,

00:48:27.360 --> 00:48:29.790
so they didn’t marry anyone.

00:48:29.790 --> 00:48:33.030
You are a reliable brother.

00:48:34.400 --> 00:48:39.100
I heard that yesterday Benin accused the king.

00:48:40.540 --> 00:48:44.110
Yesterday everyone behaved strangely towards the king.

00:48:44.410 --> 00:48:48.110
It's as if the king is hiding something.

00:48:50.650 --> 00:48:52.920
This king is different from the deceased one.

00:48:52.920 --> 00:48:55.350
That's how it should be. You chose it yourself.

00:48:55.350 --> 00:48:58.990
I elevated the king to his place for only one reason.

00:48:58.990 --> 00:49:02.560
So that you don't have to make painful decisions,

00:49:02.560 --> 00:49:04.900
as it was under the late king.

00:49:04.930 --> 00:49:06.360
And it's true.

00:49:07.230 --> 00:49:09.730
It was quite painful.

00:49:09.900 --> 00:49:12.240
I defended the country at the cost of my grandson's blood

00:49:12.240 --> 00:49:14.070
in my arms.

00:49:14.470 --> 00:49:16.070
And if anyone dares to destroy it,

00:49:16.070 --> 00:49:19.440
he will not be forgiven.

00:49:21.450 --> 00:49:25.820
Detective department.

00:50:13.300 --> 00:50:15.700
-First you have to.
-No, you first.

00:50:15.700 --> 00:50:18.440
No, you first.

00:50:47.470 --> 00:50:49.170
Where am I?

00:50:49.700 --> 00:50:52.600
In Joseon or Korea?

00:50:58.940 --> 00:51:00.580
In Joseon.

00:51:02.880 --> 00:51:05.120
I can't say I'm glad because I lost them

00:51:05.120 --> 00:51:08.420
but I can’t say that I’m sad, because I’m glad that I can check it out.

00:51:09.550 --> 00:51:13.020
Why does everything sparkle so much here?

00:51:32.640 --> 00:51:34.550
Gold of the Empire.

00:51:34.680 --> 00:51:36.450
Incas?

00:51:39.750 --> 00:51:41.220
Your Majesty!

00:51:43.820 --> 00:51:46.790
It seemed to me that I was in some other place.

00:51:47.760 --> 00:51:50.530
You've finally woken up!

00:51:51.000 --> 00:51:52.630
It's like deja vu.

00:51:52.630 --> 00:51:54.870
Just let's not make any fuss.

00:51:56.530 --> 00:51:59.240
But you almost died.

00:51:59.240 --> 00:52:01.510
They even stopped breathing completely.

00:52:02.970 --> 00:52:04.710
Don't cry.

00:52:05.640 --> 00:52:07.140
Stopped breathing?

00:52:07.380 --> 00:52:09.680
According to the royal physician,
you were without a vegetable.

00:52:09.680 --> 00:52:11.980
As if you had died.

00:52:12.920 --> 00:52:15.090
So, here too.

00:52:15.490 --> 00:52:17.420
But where am I?

00:52:18.520 --> 00:52:20.690
You are home.

00:52:21.530 --> 00:52:22.760
So,

00:52:22.760 --> 00:52:24.660
I can't avoid meeting

00:52:24.660 --> 00:52:27.060
someone you shouldn't date.

00:52:27.060 --> 00:52:29.930
-What?
- So, no difficulties,

00:52:29.930 --> 00:52:32.340
but there is someone here with whom I don’t feel at ease.

00:52:32.840 --> 00:52:35.510
The one who is essentially my real enemy -

00:52:36.610 --> 00:52:38.510
the woman's father.

00:52:38.710 --> 00:52:40.180
Your Majesty.

00:52:40.710 --> 00:52:43.580
-This is happiness, queen.
-God.

00:52:43.580 --> 00:52:47.690
Your Majesty, are you okay? Can you breathe?

00:52:47.690 --> 00:52:50.290
What do you want? Should I call the royal physician?

00:52:50.290 --> 00:52:53.060
It looks like you're about to lose consciousness.

00:52:53.190 --> 00:52:55.690
Here, drink.

00:52:55.690 --> 00:52:57.230
Fine.

00:52:58.060 --> 00:53:00.530
These are herbs for restoring yin energy.

00:53:00.530 --> 00:53:02.100
Excellent.

00:53:02.300 --> 00:53:05.200
Why are you so sweaty?

00:53:07.840 --> 00:53:09.340
Holy heavens.

00:53:09.340 --> 00:53:12.280
I was so worried.

00:53:12.280 --> 00:53:15.080
I didn't sleep last night.

00:53:15.080 --> 00:53:16.350
I completely lost my appetite

00:53:16.350 --> 00:53:18.520
and I haven’t eaten anything for two days.

00:53:18.520 --> 00:53:22.120
Every time I get up I feel dizzy.

00:53:22.390 --> 00:53:24.290
-You must be deeply shocked.
-Yes.

00:53:24.720 --> 00:53:27.190
The root of disease is worries and troubles,

00:53:27.190 --> 00:53:28.990
you need to rest and calm down.

00:53:28.990 --> 00:53:31.960
Yes, of course, I will do that.

00:53:31.960 --> 00:53:34.330
Hope you feel better soon. It's time for me to go.

00:53:34.330 --> 00:53:36.230
Your Majesty.

00:53:36.230 --> 00:53:37.840
Where are you going?

00:53:38.570 --> 00:53:39.740
Holy saints.

00:53:39.740 --> 00:53:42.710
I can't do this. I have to show respect.

00:53:42.940 --> 00:53:44.410
Your Majesty.

00:53:44.410 --> 00:53:46.840
That's it. What are you doing? You're embarrassing me.

00:53:46.840 --> 00:53:48.510
No, no, I don’t dare.

00:53:48.510 --> 00:53:50.920
Please accept my bow, Your Majesty.

00:53:52.920 --> 00:53:54.390
No!

00:53:56.650 --> 00:53:57.960
Look, you.

00:53:57.960 --> 00:53:59.520
How so?

00:54:00.190 --> 00:54:03.030
Let me bow to you once again.

00:54:03.060 --> 00:54:04.600
Father.

00:54:04.630 --> 00:54:07.430
Being a queen in Joseon is so uncomfortable.

00:54:07.430 --> 00:54:09.330
Let me while I'm here

00:54:09.330 --> 00:54:13.240
to just be your daughter Soyeon.

00:54:16.210 --> 00:54:19.840
The higher the position, the greater the loneliness.

00:54:20.710 --> 00:54:22.210
Okay, I understand.

00:54:22.610 --> 00:54:24.550
While you're here

00:54:24.550 --> 00:54:26.620
I'll do it this way

00:54:26.620 --> 00:54:29.820
as you wish.

00:54:30.520 --> 00:54:32.290
Okay, now sit down.

00:54:32.560 --> 00:54:35.360
Fine. Thank you.

00:54:36.290 --> 00:54:38.130
Be careful.

00:54:44.870 --> 00:54:48.740
No matter how you decorate the room,
it still seemed empty.

00:54:49.110 --> 00:54:53.510
But as soon as you returned, the room began to shine.

00:54:55.150 --> 00:54:56.580
Yes.

00:54:56.680 --> 00:55:00.990
The room is so bright that it blinds your eyes.

00:55:01.890 --> 00:55:03.690
I like.

00:55:06.520 --> 00:55:10.030
Don't worry, nothing will tarnish your reputation.

00:55:10.090 --> 00:55:12.700
I took care of everything.

00:55:12.800 --> 00:55:15.930
I have prepared all the best.

00:55:54.840 --> 00:55:56.470
Next one, come on in.

00:55:57.170 --> 00:55:59.640
I didn't see a single doctor there,

00:55:59.640 --> 00:56:01.550
and there's a whole crowd here?

00:56:09.250 --> 00:56:11.290
Is anyone else due to come?

00:56:11.290 --> 00:56:14.330
-Some kind of holiday?
-This is breakfast.

00:56:18.100 --> 00:56:19.560
To restore strength

00:56:19.560 --> 00:56:22.200
your father made you turtle soup.

00:56:22.200 --> 00:56:23.600
Here.

00:56:26.170 --> 00:56:28.270
Turtles in the morning?

00:56:30.840 --> 00:56:32.610
Be careful.

00:56:35.080 --> 00:56:37.780
Why? What's there?

00:56:47.930 --> 00:56:51.160
It's such an honor to serve you, Your Majesty.

00:56:56.600 --> 00:56:59.800
She is the best beauty artist in Joseon.

00:57:00.070 --> 00:57:02.940
I'm naturally beautiful. I don't need her help.

00:57:05.110 --> 00:57:06.710
Come on in.

00:57:16.750 --> 00:57:19.320
Call for overthrow and poisoning.

00:57:19.920 --> 00:57:23.060
They are doing everything to get rid of Her Majesty.

00:57:23.060 --> 00:57:24.660
Don't worry.

00:57:25.230 --> 00:57:28.230
No matter how hard they try
harm Her Majesty,

00:57:28.800 --> 00:57:31.000
I will increase my power.

00:57:32.570 --> 00:57:37.040
With a brother like you, she has nothing to worry about.

00:57:44.980 --> 00:57:47.250
Are you familiar with this material?

00:57:47.250 --> 00:57:49.450
This is regular silk.

00:57:50.420 --> 00:57:53.290
Is there something wrong with him?

00:57:53.320 --> 00:57:56.960
Have you given someone clothes made from this material?

00:57:58.360 --> 00:58:01.370
After Her Majesty became Queen,

00:58:01.370 --> 00:58:04.600
I only received gifts, I didn’t give them myself.

00:58:05.070 --> 00:58:08.940
The only person I offer gifts to is the Queen Dowager.

00:58:09.340 --> 00:58:10.840
It's clear.

00:58:12.210 --> 00:58:14.110
But you know...

00:58:14.780 --> 00:58:17.980
Recently my warehouse has been robbed twice.

00:58:18.850 --> 00:58:22.120
This silk could be there.

00:58:22.120 --> 00:58:24.660
Was your home attacked?

00:58:24.660 --> 00:58:26.490
No no.

00:58:27.090 --> 00:58:29.890
It is dangerous to keep all your valuables in one place.

00:58:29.890 --> 00:58:32.560
It is better to place them in different places.

00:58:32.560 --> 00:58:34.630
I have several warehouses.

00:58:35.400 --> 00:58:40.900
But the robbers chose only those with the most valuable things.

00:58:44.440 --> 00:58:47.610
Just thinking about it, my neck immediately goes numb.

00:58:49.310 --> 00:58:51.520
My beloved treasures.

00:58:52.350 --> 00:58:54.850
Is it possible to find out among the stolen

00:58:54.850 --> 00:58:56.850
was this silk or not?

00:58:58.120 --> 00:58:59.790
Too much has been stolen.

00:58:59.790 --> 00:59:03.260
And keeping records of valuable property was dangerous.

00:59:04.190 --> 00:59:06.360
By the way...

00:59:08.900 --> 00:59:11.200
Don't tell anyone about the warehouses.

00:59:11.200 --> 00:59:14.100
It's not good if people find out about this.

00:59:14.570 --> 00:59:15.970
I understand.

00:59:16.670 --> 00:59:22.180
But have you heard anything strange from your father?

00:59:23.380 --> 00:59:25.280
Did something happen?

00:59:27.150 --> 00:59:31.690
This whole situation with Her Majesty: saved the king with his concubine

00:59:31.690 --> 00:59:35.590
and ruined her relationship with the Queen Dowager - worries me.

00:59:36.260 --> 00:59:39.830
I have nightmares in which she is overthrown.

00:59:39.960 --> 00:59:43.300
Overthrown? Why are you thinking about this?

00:59:44.500 --> 00:59:47.270
There are rumors that one of the queen contenders

00:59:47.300 --> 00:59:50.140
delivered a secret message.

00:59:50.340 --> 00:59:54.010
Is it possible that they want to choose a new queen?

00:59:54.880 --> 00:59:58.950
I'm so worried that I've been overeating these days.

01:00:00.480 --> 01:00:03.720
They will not give up on Her Majesty.

01:00:04.320 --> 01:00:06.490
Is it true?

01:00:06.990 --> 01:00:12.660
I have to try and send
more gifts for the Queen Dowager.

01:00:14.230 --> 01:00:16.030
How are you feeling?

01:00:16.030 --> 01:00:17.500
What?

01:00:17.800 --> 01:00:20.570
This is nothing. I'll be there soon...

01:00:21.370 --> 01:00:23.540
No, maybe not so fast.

01:00:24.910 --> 01:00:26.910
How could this happen?

01:00:28.180 --> 01:00:32.050
I completely forgot that I was no longer young and was careless.

01:00:36.520 --> 01:00:39.920
I don't have time for fun.

01:00:52.370 --> 01:00:53.600
How are you feeling?

01:00:53.600 --> 01:00:55.640
I look like a doll.

01:00:55.640 --> 01:00:57.140
Wonderful!

01:00:57.740 --> 01:01:01.010
Do you like it?

01:01:27.800 --> 01:01:30.670
This book is already overgrown with mold.

01:01:31.610 --> 01:01:33.910
Terrible stench.

01:01:34.310 --> 01:01:35.980
If you were a man

01:01:35.980 --> 01:01:38.450
would enter the palace after passing the state exam.

01:01:38.450 --> 01:01:40.850
You really enjoyed studying.

01:01:42.420 --> 01:01:44.320
Who liked to study it?

01:01:44.320 --> 01:01:46.790
I tried only for my father.

01:01:47.690 --> 01:01:50.090
Mom died giving me life.

01:01:50.390 --> 01:01:53.330
And I decided that I had to pay back for this.

01:01:53.660 --> 01:01:55.730
Apparently that's why you even at night

01:01:55.730 --> 01:01:59.000
We studied hard on our birthday.

01:02:09.880 --> 01:02:11.380
Soyeon.

01:02:16.550 --> 01:02:18.360
Happy birthday.

01:02:23.860 --> 01:02:27.930
Because on my birthday we remembered my mother,

01:02:29.830 --> 01:02:31.940
I never smiled.

01:02:34.270 --> 01:02:36.270
What was that now?

01:02:36.540 --> 01:02:37.970
Your Majesty.

01:02:38.480 --> 01:02:42.150
Your memories come back!

01:02:43.810 --> 01:02:47.150
What? What are these memories that seem to be mine, but not really?

01:02:57.960 --> 01:02:59.730
Kim Changhyuk

01:02:59.930 --> 01:03:03.100
Out of the way! Go away!

01:03:04.330 --> 01:03:07.500
Kim Chang-hyuk, current Minister of War.

01:03:07.770 --> 01:03:10.140
Together with a group of military men he collected

01:03:10.340 --> 01:03:12.240
excessively high war tax.

01:03:14.340 --> 01:03:17.280
Kim Seok-keun, current left-wing councilor.

01:03:17.310 --> 01:03:18.680
Responsible for finances

01:03:18.680 --> 01:03:20.250
through the grain exchange

01:03:20.250 --> 01:03:22.190
appropriates royal gifts.

01:03:23.020 --> 01:03:25.490
Kim Byung-hak, current State Councilor.

01:03:25.690 --> 01:03:27.290
Tax criminal:

01:03:27.290 --> 01:03:29.660
conspired with local governors

01:03:29.760 --> 01:03:31.660
and imposed taxes on empty lands.

01:03:35.400 --> 01:03:37.000
Kim Mungeun.

01:03:37.600 --> 01:03:39.370
Queen's father.

01:03:39.570 --> 01:03:41.100
This is what I'm talking about.

01:03:46.240 --> 01:03:48.110
Queen's father

01:03:48.110 --> 01:03:49.680
head of the royal guard.

01:03:49.680 --> 01:03:51.380
Famous manufacturer

01:03:51.380 --> 01:03:54.480
dealing with everything from rice loans to the war tax system.

01:03:58.890 --> 01:04:00.390
Kim Jwageun.

01:04:01.490 --> 01:04:03.190
Acting troop commander.

01:04:17.740 --> 01:04:19.040
At the peak of its power,

01:04:19.040 --> 01:04:22.350
the one who founded this entire corrupt system.

01:04:25.850 --> 01:04:27.280
Secret

01:04:47.170 --> 01:04:49.840
Everyone in the palace has a secret.

01:04:52.110 --> 01:04:54.310
A secret hidden by lies.

01:04:55.380 --> 01:04:59.050
A secret that cannot be seen or heard.

01:04:59.950 --> 01:05:01.990
A secret waiting for the right moment.

01:05:08.120 --> 01:05:10.760
To keep a secret deep in your heart,

01:05:12.930 --> 01:05:15.030
Initial Instruction for Children

01:05:16.500 --> 01:05:19.370
we all wear masks.

01:05:21.810 --> 01:05:24.470
Cho Hwajin

01:06:09.220 --> 01:06:11.350
But the secret

01:06:13.990 --> 01:06:16.060
will definitely open up.

01:06:40.180 --> 01:06:43.620
Your Majesty, your memories have returned!

01:06:46.990 --> 01:06:49.390
Everything is confused. Go away, woman, go away!

01:06:49.390 --> 01:06:52.430
Why do you keep getting weirder and weirder over time?

01:06:52.430 --> 01:06:55.030
There is something I haven't told anyone about.

01:06:55.030 --> 01:06:56.930
-Help.
-That smell of dampness.

01:06:56.930 --> 01:06:59.870
Recently, many warehouses have been robbed in the capital.

01:06:59.870 --> 01:07:01.570
-And what?
-I'm interested

01:07:01.570 --> 01:07:03.840
maybe this is how you make money.

01:07:03.940 --> 01:07:06.710
Today we will clear everything up.

01:07:06.710 --> 01:07:08.580
This is what I was waiting for.
